  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">For $30 educate and support vulnerable children</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">It&apos;s no secret that education is a critically important path out of poverty for children in slums and depressed rural areas in Northern Uganda. Our LEAD education program is unique, long-term, and integrated with our other programs to maximize success. CHILD aims to alleviate poverty and facilitate lasting change in the lives of the most vulnerable children and families living in Northern Uganda through education, health, and livelihood programs.</narrative>
  </description>
